OL,3,GNEWSAHospital discharge delays continue
OL,4,Afor seventh year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of days patients "fit" to
OL,7,Fleave hospital waited to be transferred
OL,8,Fto suitable care was triple the monthly
OL,9,Ftarget in 2025 - and below target for
OL,10,Fthe seventh year running  - a
OL,11,Fhealthcare report for Guernsey has
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FThe report, which was published on
OL,15,FMonday, external also indicated all
OL,16,Fwaiting times were longer than
OL,17,Ftargeted, while formal complaints rose
OL,18,Fby 27% in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
