OL,3,GNEWSAHospital discharge delays continue
OL,4,Afor seventh year
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Dr George Oswald, President of
OL,7,Fthe Committee for Health and Social
OL,8,FCare, recognised "challenges remain",
OL,9,Fwith "too many patients" waiting
OL,10,F"longer than we would like for
OL,11,Ftreatment".
OL,13,FAddressing these issues would require
OL,14,Fcontinued "collaboration across
OL,15,Fhealthcare, social care and the wider
OL,16,Fcommunity", he added.
